<%- layout("layout/boilerplate") %>
  <div class="container h-100">
    <div class="row justify-content-around h-100 pt-5">
      <div class="col-9">
        <div class="card text-center">
          <div class="card-header">
            <h1>Note Pad</h1>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title"></h5>
            <p class="card-text">Here you will be able to add your plans and important information</p>

          </div>
          <div class="card-footer text-muted">
            Last updated: 2 days ago <a href="#" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm">Edit</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row justify-content-around h-100 pt-5">
      <div class="col-9 ">
        <h1 class="text-center">News</h1>
        <div class="accordion" id="accordionExample">
          <div class="accordion-item">
            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingOne">
              <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseOne"
                aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="collapseOne">
                Recently Updates
              </button>
            </h2>
            <div id="collapseOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse " aria-labelledby="headingOne"
              data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
              <div class="accordion-body">
                <strong>Below will show any recent updates or changes made to the AO Tool</strong>
                <p>- Site made and open to select few for testing</p>

              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="accordion-item">
            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingTwo">
              <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                data-bs-target="#collapseTwo" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseTwo">
                Wish List
              </button>
            </h2>
            <div id="collapseTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingTwo"
              data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
              <div class="accordion-body">
                <strong>List of features i would like to add to the AO Tool</strong>
                <p>- scratch book on main page, to write down tactics and stratagies</p>
                <p>- enhanced attack calculator (single win/loss result)</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="accordion-item">
            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingThree">
              <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                data-bs-target="#collapseThree" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseThree">
                Known Issues
              </button>
            </h2>
            <div id="collapseThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingThree"
              data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
              <div class="accordion-body">
                <strong>Any on going issues im aware of</strong>
                <p> - bonuses arnt taken into account</p>

              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row justify-content-around h-100 pt-5">
      <div class="col-9 ">
        <h1 class="text-center">Quick Tips</h1>
        <div class="accordion" id="accordionExample">
          <div class="accordion-item">
            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingOne">
              <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseOne1"
                aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="collapseOne">
                Networth Calculator
              </button>
            </h2>
            <div id="collapseOne1" class="accordion-collapse collapse " aria-labelledby="headingOne"
              data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
              <div class="accordion-body">
                <strong>This is used to calculate your networth and power stats</strong>
                <p>Replicate your desired setup like you would normally build on AO. Entering buildings, units,
                  research and land etc and use the readouts at the top to see your NW and power stats</p>
                <p>Once you have your setup your province you can use the stats page to get some info and then also be
                  able to use the Attack/defend calculator. </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="accordion-item">
            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingTwo">
              <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                data-bs-target="#collapseTwo1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseTwo">
                Power Calculator
              </button>
            </h2>
            <div id="collapseTwo1" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingTwo"
              data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
              <div class="accordion-body">
                <strong>This is used to calculate enemys power grid</strong>
                <p>Just input your enemyies spy report into the calculator to get a <strong>ROUGH</strong> calculation
                  on thier power</p>
                <p>Be warned this is not an exact science. This is calculated using average numbers of the spy reports
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="accordion-item">
            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingThree">
              <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                data-bs-target="#collapseThree1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseThree">
                Win/Loss Calculator
              </button>
            </h2>
            <div id="collapseThree1" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingThree"
              data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
              <div class="accordion-body">
                <strong>This calculator will show you if you can win vs your enemy</strong>
                <p> Enter your units like you would normally and return to the attack calcuulator page. Then enter the
                  enemies spy reports. This will give you a <strong>ROUGH</strong> estimate of if you would win or
                  loss </p>
                <p>Be warned this is not an exact science. This is calculated using average numbers of the spy reports
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>